#: listkeys.cpp:1429
msgid ""
"Secret keys SHOULD NOT be saved in an unsafe place.\n"
"If someone else can access this file, encryption with this key will be "
"compromised!\n"
"Continue key export?"
msgstr ""
"Калиди махфӣ НАБОЯД, ки дар ҷойҳои "
